  "contract": [
    "Round-8 tester (2026-11-15): Mandokir (11382) neither yelled \"Ding!\" nor showed the Level Up visual when he",
    "killed a player, and did not grow. The script added the Level Up! dose (2118416) without a cast, so its",
    "visual never played, and yelled only on streak kills 1, 3, 5, 7 and 10. User decision 2026-11-15: every kill",
    "yells \"Ding!\" and grows him by stock Level Up's (24312) +20% scale; 2118416 itself has no scale effect.",
    "A Mythic Mandokir kills two heroes in turn while a third stays alive; each kill is one cast, one dose,",
    "one yell and +20% size, and an evade takes the doses and the growth away. The harness cannot read the yell's",
    "text or see the visual."
